Tick cost probe: /trb tickcost [seconds 1-600|stop|calibrate|powercheck].
Times the 20Hz tick by section and the addon's frame scripts. Local measurement only: never merge it.

Apply:   git apply build/patches/tickcost-probe.patch
Remove:  git apply -R build/patches/tickcost-probe.patch

When a Core change stops it applying, refresh it in the same pull request:
  1. Commit the Core change, then run git apply -3 build/patches/tickcost-probe.patch and resolve the conflicts.
  2. git diff HEAD --output=build/patches/tickcost-probe.patch -- Core/Init.lua Core/Classes/BarVisibility.lua Core/Functions/CurveMemo.lua
  3. Put this header back above the first diff line.
  4. git checkout HEAD -- Core/Init.lua Core/Classes/BarVisibility.lua Core/Functions/CurveMemo.lua

